<section class="connection-guide" aria-labelledby="connection-guide-title">
  <header class="visual-heading">
    <span class="visual-eyebrow">図解で選ぶ</span>
    <h2 id="connection-guide-title">光回線とホームルーター、<br class="mobile-break" />どちらを選ぶ？</h2>
    <p>まずは「工事ができるか」で分けると、候補を選びやすくなります。</p>
  </header>

  <div class="connection-grid">
    <article class="connection-card fiber-card">
      <div class="connection-card-heading"><span class="type-chip">家まで回線を引き込む</span><h3>光回線</h3></div>
      <figure class="connection-figure">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 480 258" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <ellipse cx="258" cy="236" rx="190" ry="14" fill="#d6e7df" />
          <path d="M34 100V232M17 111h34M18 151h32" fill="none" stroke="#94b3a4" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <path d="M36 110H99L146 132H231" fill="none" stroke="#d78445" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <path d="m152 99 125-72 125 72v127H152Z" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#175d50" stroke-width="3" />
          <path d="m139 107 138-80 138 80" fill="none" stroke="#175d50" stroke-width="17" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          <path d="M164 119h226v95H164Z" fill="#f4f0de" />
          <rect x="183" y="128" width="47" height="49" rx="4" fill="#d0e7e2" stroke="#639382" stroke-width="3" />
          <path d="M207 130v45M185 152h43" stroke="#fffdf8" stroke-width="3" />
          <path d="M279 213V178M250 213h107" stroke="#a78c65" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <rect x="256" y="139" width="74" height="45" rx="5" fill="#fff" stroke="#2c6a5b" stroke-width="3" />
          <rect x="264" y="147" width="58" height="29" rx="2" fill="#d2e9e5" />
          <path d="m277 164 9 8 16-17" fill="none" stroke="#175d50" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          <rect x="345" y="178" width="33" height="31" rx="5" fill="#fff" stroke="#2c6a5b" stroke-width="3" />
          <path d="M354 179v-14M369 179v-14" stroke="#2c6a5b" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <circle cx="354" cy="199" r="2" fill="#d78445" /><circle cx="362" cy="199" r="2" fill="#2c6a5b" />
          <path d="M231 132v70h113" fill="none" stroke="#d78445" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <circle cx="231" cy="132" r="7" fill="#d78445" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" />
          <path d="M343 155q18-17 36 0M351 163q10-9 20 0" fill="none" stroke="#7cae98" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <circle cx="361" cy="171" r="2.5" fill="#7cae98" />
          <path d="m430 146 8-18 8 18M438 128v76" fill="none" stroke="#abc7aa" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <circle cx="438" cy="119" r="22" fill="#cadbb7" /><circle cx="424" cy="141" r="18" fill="#cadbb7" /><circle cx="451" cy="144" r="16" fill="#cadbb7" />
        </svg>
        <figcaption><span class="line-key"></span>光ファイバー <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> 家のルーター</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="connection-content">
        <p class="connection-answer"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span> 家の固定回線を使いたい人に</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li><b>工事</b><span>原則、開通工事あり</span></li>
          <li><b>接続</b><span>家まで引き込んだ回線を利用</span></li>
          <li><b>確認</b><span>提供エリアと建物の設備</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="connection-note">既設設備や乗換え方法によっては、新しい引込み工事が不要な場合もあります。</p>
        <a href="/hikari/kagoshima/#compare" class="connection-link">光回線の料金を比べる <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="connection-card wireless-card">
      <div class="connection-card-heading"><span class="type-chip">電波を受けてネットにつなぐ</span><h3>ホームルーター</h3></div>
      <figure class="connection-figure">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 480 258" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <ellipse cx="270" cy="236" rx="172" ry="14" fill="#e8dfc8" />
          <path d="m48 227 28-107 28 107M60 184h31M66 156h18M47 227h58" fill="none" stroke="#bd7846" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          <circle cx="76" cy="110" r="6" fill="#d78445" />
          <path d="M59 96q-16 14 0 28M93 96q16 14 0 28M47 83q-30 28 0 55M105 83q30 28 0 55" fill="none" stroke="#d9a67a" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <path d="m164 101 113-70 113 70v125H164Z" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#7c8161" stroke-width="3" />
          <path d="m151 108 126-77 126 77" fill="none" stroke="#7b8667" stroke-width="16" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          <path d="M176 119h202v95H176Z" fill="#f5ecd8" />
          <rect x="304" y="129" width="48" height="47" rx="4" fill="#d2e5dc" stroke="#839e87" stroke-width="3" />
          <path d="M328 131v43M306 153h44" stroke="#fffdf8" stroke-width="3" />
          <path d="M208 210v-27M196 210h82" stroke="#ac9273" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <rect x="209" y="132" width="50" height="58" rx="12" fill="#fff" stroke="#a65d35" stroke-width="3" />
          <ellipse cx="234" cy="140" rx="17" ry="3" fill="#f0d8c5" />
          <circle cx="234" cy="176" r="3" fill="#d78445" />
          <path d="M259 182h25v22h18" fill="none" stroke="#a78d70" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <rect x="302" y="197" width="15" height="14" rx="3" fill="#fff" stroke="#a78d70" stroke-width="2" />
          <path d="M307 201v5M312 201v5" stroke="#a78d70" stroke-width="2" />
          <path d="M123 115q36-15 76 16" fill="none" stroke="#d78445" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="4 9" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <path d="m190 116 11 17-20-2" fill="none" stroke="#d78445" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          <path d="M215 109q19-17 38 0M224 118q10-9 20 0" fill="none" stroke="#d78445" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <circle cx="234" cy="125" r="2.5" fill="#d78445" />
          <rect x="328" y="191" width="31" height="20" rx="3" fill="#fff" stroke="#78947f" stroke-width="3" />
          <path d="M334 197h19M334 203h12" stroke="#bdd8cb" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <circle cx="429" cy="172" r="27" fill="#dedfc3" /><path d="M429 197v34M417 230h24" fill="none" stroke="#9d9d7f" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" />
        </svg>
        <figcaption><span class="wave-key" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span>基地局の電波 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> 家のルーター</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="connection-content">
        <p class="connection-answer"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span> 回線工事をせずに使いたい人に</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li><b>工事</b><span>開通工事は不要</span></li>
          <li><b>接続</b><span>設置する場所の電波で変わる</span></li>
          <li><b>確認</b><span>端末代と途中解約時の残額</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="connection-note">端末を購入する契約では、短期間の解約で分割払いの残額が生じる場合があります。</p>
        <a href="/hikari/home-router/" class="connection-link">工事なしの2候補を比べる <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="decision-reminder"><span class="reminder-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span><p><b>「工事なし」でも、やめるときの費用は別。</b><span>利用する期間を決めて、月額・工事費・端末代を合わせて選びましょう。</span></p></div>
</section>

<section class="signup-guide" aria-labelledby="signup-guide-title">
  <header class="visual-heading"><span class="visual-eyebrow">申込み前のチェック</span><h2 id="signup-guide-title">この3ステップで、<br class="mobile-break" />条件をそろえて選ぶ。</h2></header>
  <ol class="signup-steps">
    <li>
      <span class="step-number">01</span>
      <div class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" focusable="false"><path d="M40 68S17 47 17 29a23 23 0 0 1 46 0c0 18-23 39-23 39Z" fill="#d6e8df" stroke="#175d50" stroke-width="3" /><circle cx="40" cy="29" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#175d50" stroke-width="3" /><path d="m11 66 15-5M54 62l15 4" stroke="#c8b28a" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg></div>
      <h3>住所で使えるか</h3><p>市町村だけでなく、<br />番地・建物の設備まで確認。</p><span class="step-tag">提供エリア・建物設備</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="step-number">02</span>
      <div class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" focusable="false"><rect x="17" y="8" width="46" height="64" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#175d50" stroke-width="3" /><rect x="25" y="17" width="30" height="13" rx="2" fill="#d6e8df" /><path d="M26 41h5M39 41h5M52 41h2M26 52h5M39 52h5M26 63h5M39 63h5" stroke="#175d50" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" /><rect x="50" y="49" width="7" height="17" rx="2" fill="#d78445" /></svg></div>
      <h3>支払いを合わせる</h3><p>月額＋工事費・端末代。<br />必要なオプションも加算。</p><span class="step-tag">利用中・解約時の費用</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="step-number">03</span>
      <div class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" focusable="false"><rect x="16" y="13" width="48" height="58" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#175d50" stroke-width="3" /><rect x="28" y="7" width="24" height="12" rx="4" fill="#d6e8df" stroke="#175d50" stroke-width="3" /><path d="m26 34 4 4 7-8M42 34h11M26 48h27M26 59h18" fill="none" stroke="#175d50" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /><circle cx="59" cy="61" r="12" fill="#d78445" /><path d="m53 61 4 4 8-9" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg></div>
      <h3>特典と開通日で決める</h3><p>受取時期・継続条件と、<br />使い始めたい日を確認。</p><span class="step-tag">窓口の条件・開通予定</span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <a class="signup-compare" href="/hikari/kagoshima/#compare">条件をそろえて、光回線の比較表へ <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</section>

